# INVWINPK.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the pick lists of
# the item form's category and location.  In view mode the form has no
# "..." button, and CTRL-E switches to edit mode.  There F4 in Category
# drops its list on the item's category; a letter selects the next row
# that starts with it; Enter closes the list on that row, Esc on the
# row it had when it dropped, the focus staying in the field.  F4 in
# Location opens the location tree on the item's location, after its
# first row (no location), where a new item's opens; its Esc also
# leaves it; its Down, End, Home, PgDn and PgUp move over it,
# Tab cycles list, OK and Cancel and F1 shows the form's help; a location
# chosen puts its code in the field and its path below it.  The seed
# has three locations, one page, so no choice from a second page is
# tried.  A new item takes both codes from the picks and is added; its
# form, opened again, shows them.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPK.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
# item 1 in view mode: no buttons; CTRL-E switches to edit mode
K ENTER
S VIEW
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
# the category list, a letter, Enter
K F4
S CAT
K D
S CATD
K ENTER
S CATOK
# the list again: P jumps to PERI, P again to PART, a letter that starts
# no row (X) stays; Esc closes the list back on DRV
K F4 P
S CATP
K P X
S CATPP
K ESC
S CATESC
# F1 in the list shows the help of the field, Category, which closes
# the list; Esc closes the help
K F4 F1
S CATHELP
K ESC
# Location by its letter
K ALT-L
K F4
S LOC
K ESC
S LOCESC
# DOWN, END, HOME and PGDN move on the one page; TAB cycles the list, OK
# and Cancel, and Enter on Cancel chooses nothing
K F4 DOWN
S LOCDOWN
K END
S LOCEND
K HOME PGDN PGUP
S LOCHOME
K TAB
S LOCTAB1
K TAB
S LOCTAB2
K TAB
S LOCTAB3
K ENTER
S LOCCNCL
K F4 F1
S LOCHELP
K ESC ESC
K F4 DOWN ENTER
S LOCPICK
# Esc afterwards leaves A1
K F4 ESC
S LOCKEPT
K ENTER
S SAVED
# item 1 again: the saved codes
K ENTER
S VIEWED
K ESC
# a new item: codes from the picks
K INS
S NEW
K F4 D ENTER
K ALT-M
T Commodore
K TAB
T PET 2001
K ALT-L F4 DOWN ENTER
S NEWPICK
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END ENTER
S NEWSHOWN
K ESC
K ALT-F X
